sequenceDiagram
autonumber
participant W as Worker / API
participant P as AI #1 prompt builder
participant D as PostgreSQL
participant L as AI #2 provider
participant V as Validator
W->>P: sanitized attempt + rubric + schema
P->>P: deterministic template + hash
P->>D: ai_prompt_record + content
W->>L: POST /chat/completions (AI2)
L-->>W: JSON (score, criteria, evidence)
W->>V: schema + score band + evidence check
alt valid
  V-->>W: accepted
  W->>D: evaluation_record / result evidence
else invalid or provider error
  V-->>W: rejected
  W->>D: fallback rule result / failed job
end
Note over P,L: OPENROUTER_DATA_COLLECTION=deny, OPENROUTER_ZDR=true in release
